review:
If anyone wonders why this game was so exalted when it came out - it has a all the best things for an ideal RPG:
1. Multiple ways of finishing quests;
2. Incredibly polished, huge amount of side quests, which are non-repetitive, unique and hard to predict in its stories;
3. So more than enough characters, skills, methods of play, weapons and utilities...

All in all - it provides everything You might need to make Your own story. Evil or Good. Heroic or bastardly. You decide.
